      "status": "not_affected",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "Cargo.lock resolves webpki-roots 0.26.11 to webpki-roots 1.0.10. The 0.26.11 compatibility crate re-exports the 1.x trust store and has no independent roots; 1.0.10 removes the affected root. In addition, the 0.26.11 dependency is only reachable through async-nats websockets, which the workspace does not enable. Evidence: https://github.com/wasmCloud/wasmCloud/tree/5de84384e837a5632f0bfc3a0f96a1e6a1a8b77b/Cargo.lock; https://github.com/wasmCloud/wasmCloud/tree/5de84384e837a5632f0bfc3a0f96a1e6a1a8b77b/Cargo.toml; https://docs.rs/crate/webpki-roots/0.26.11/source/src/lib.rs.",
      "status_notes": "Assessed source: https://github.com/wasmCloud/wasmCloud/tree/5de84384e837a5632f0bfc3a0f96a1e6a1a8b77b. Covers the identified wash release binaries and default/all-features wash images with repository-defined features. Reassess when dependencies, features, or code paths change."
