      "status": "not_affected",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "The only reverse dependency of zstd 0.13.3 is wasmtime-internal-cache 48.0.8. Its cache uses encode_all and decode_all, which create fresh contexts; it does not use the affected stream Encoder::with_context or Decoder::with_context APIs to reuse contexts. The wasmCloud engine configuration also does not enable Wasmtime disk caching. Evidence: https://docs.rs/crate/wasmtime-internal-cache/48.0.8/source/src/lib.rs; https://docs.rs/crate/wasmtime-internal-cache/48.0.8/source/src/worker.rs; https://github.com/wasmCloud/wasmCloud/tree/5de84384e837a5632f0bfc3a0f96a1e6a1a8b77b/crates/wash-runtime/src/engine/mod.rs. Checked with cargo tree --locked --offline -p wash --all-features --target all -i zstd.",
      "status_notes": "Assessed source: https://github.com/wasmCloud/wasmCloud/tree/5de84384e837a5632f0bfc3a0f96a1e6a1a8b77b. Covers the identified wash release binaries and default/all-features wash images with repository-defined features. Reassess when dependencies, features, or code paths change."
