      "status": "not_affected",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "The affected seekable decompression APIs require the zstd-safe seekable feature. Wasmtime cache disables zstd default features, and the wash dependency graph enables only the std feature of zstd-safe 7.3.0, including with all optional wash features and all targets. The affected seekable code is not compiled. Evidence: https://docs.rs/crate/wasmtime-internal-cache/48.0.8/source/Cargo.toml; https://github.com/wasmCloud/wasmCloud/tree/5de84384e837a5632f0bfc3a0f96a1e6a1a8b77b/Cargo.lock. Checked with cargo tree --locked --offline -p wash --all-features --target all -e features -i zstd-safe --depth 1.",
