      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "Legacy frame support is not enabled: the wash graph enables only the std feature of zstd-safe 7.3.0, including with all optional wash features and all targets. Wasmtime cache disables zstd default features. Its only decompression API is decode_all, which the advisory also identifies as unaffected; it does not use stream::write::Decoder. Evidence: https://docs.rs/crate/wasmtime-internal-cache/48.0.8/source/Cargo.toml; https://docs.rs/crate/wasmtime-internal-cache/48.0.8/source/src/lib.rs; https://docs.rs/crate/wasmtime-internal-cache/48.0.8/source/src/worker.rs. Checked with cargo tree --locked --offline -p wash --all-features --target all -e features -i zstd-safe --depth 1.",
